{"4783980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GUNBOAT-8", "steam_appid": 4783980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm the GUNBOAT-8 and set sail in this naval bullet-heaven roguelike. Destroy enemy ships, claim their bounties, and discover new weapon synergies to customise your warpship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/166237650bd0aa20a283f07120650be8.poster.avif?t=1788346838\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/166237650bd0aa20a283f07120650be8.webm?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/166237650bd0aa20a283f07120650be8.mp4?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find epic loot to power up your ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/93cd30929facdf22aa82d596e69873bc.poster.avif?t=1788346838\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/93cd30929facdf22aa82d596e69873bc.webm?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/93cd30929facdf22aa82d596e69873bc.mp4?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend scraps to build the ideal warship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/4a3878d8b0636220ce448e4961ca51df.poster.avif?t=1788346838\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/4a3878d8b0636220ce448e4961ca51df.webm?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/4a3878d8b0636220ce448e4961ca51df.mp4?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain a ship:</strong> battle waves of enemies to find loot and earn rewards. Your ship attacks for you, so you just need to focus on steering!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover crazy builds:</strong> find weapons, runes and modifications to create epic combinations. Merge weapons together to construct higher tiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the seas</strong>: traverse real-world environments as you attempt to conquer the oceans, facing a variety of bosses along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit allies:</strong> recruit bosses you defeat to fight alongside you. From Blackbeard to aircraft carriers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In GUNBOAT-8 you battle waves on enemies to earn money. Money can be spent in the shop to equip new weapons and modifiers, or you can enhance your existing weapons with unique runes that change the feel of each weapon. Design around your playstyle. Want to captain the mightiest pirate ship on the seas, or would you prefer to outsource your weaponry to an army of sharks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/6fcdb5accdb65fa8e5a4d2a5268a8c2c.poster.avif?t=1788346838\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/6fcdb5accdb65fa8e5a4d2a5268a8c2c.webm?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/6fcdb5accdb65fa8e5a4d2a5268a8c2c.mp4?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm the GUNBOAT-8 and set sail in this naval bullet-heaven roguelike. Destroy enemy ships, claim their bounties, and discover new weapon synergies to customise your warpship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/166237650bd0aa20a283f07120650be8.poster.avif?t=1788346838\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/166237650bd0aa20a283f07120650be8.webm?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/166237650bd0aa20a283f07120650be8.mp4?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find epic loot to power up your ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/93cd30929facdf22aa82d596e69873bc.poster.avif?t=1788346838\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783980/extras/93cd30929facdf22aa82d596e69873bc.webm?t=1788346838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka